            </div>

            <div class="border-t border-stone-200 pt-3 flex justify-between items-center text-xs">
                <span class="font-medium text-stone-700">Total do Pedido:</span>
                <span id="carrinhoTotalValor" class="text-base font-mono font-bold text-amber-700">R$ 0,00</span>
